{"version":1,"content":"<p>以付費搜索服務替代Google而聞名的Kagi，如今將業務延伸至電子郵件領域。該公司於11月24日宣佈，正式推出名為Kagi Mail的電子郵件服務，並以公開測試版形式上線，用户可享受60天免費試用。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587748.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.207250+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:39:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"af95d1bc3bd5149c5cf0f69f196dc349aec359c4f7864ccdf8f92ec33356a0ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}